    <Folder>
      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The U.S. Navy has successfully trialed a robotic towed connector for unmanned surface vessels, conducted strikes on Iranian oil tankers, and participated in virtual exercises with the U.K. and U.S. forces. The Chinese Type 055-class guided-missile destroyer involved in a fatal collision has returned to frontline service, and the Defense Innovation Unit achieved a critical milestone by conducting a GPS-free test flight. The National Security Science and Technology Strategy recognizes the importance of human capabilities in global competition, highlighting the need for reimagining the workforce. The Department of War has launched a new capability to enhance collaboration and accelerate the delivery of critical capabilities.</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>0,0,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
